---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Beenzer DAO"
  description="The Beenzer DAO and its tokens were part of the original 2022 design. What Beenzer does on-chain today."
>
  <section class="page container">
    <p class="eyebrow">The DAO</p>
    <h1 class="display">The DAO was the first draft.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      In 2022, Beenzer was designed around a DAO, with two tokens of its own. The new app is built around posts and
      the map instead. Nothing on this site is an offer of any token.
    </p>
    <p class="lead">
      What Beenzer does on-chain today: you sign in with Phantom, and any post can be minted as a Metaplex NFT on
      Solana, kept on Arweave, with limited editions and royalties for its creator.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn" href="/#onchain">How Beenzer uses Solana <Icon name="arrow-right" /></a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="/#faq">FAQ</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page {
    display: grid;
    gap: 24px;
    justify-items: start;
    min-height: 80svh;
    align-content: center;
    padding-top: calc(var(--header-h) + clamp(64px, 10vw, 140px));
    padding-bottom: clamp(96px, 12vw, 160px);
  }
  .page .display {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6.4vw, 6.5rem);
    max-width: 13ch;
  }
  .page .lead {
    max-width: 52ch;
  }
  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
</style>
